<title>INDIA: Jammu and Kashmir election results at 0700 GMT.</title>
<headline>Jammu and Kashmir election results at 0700 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>SRINAGAR, India 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the results so far in elections to Jammu and Kashmir state's 87-member assembly:</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> PARTY					SEATS WON</p>
<p>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -</p>
<p> National Conference (NC)		  54</p>
<p> Congress					 7</p>
<p> Bharatiya Janata Party (BJP)	     7</p>
<p> Janata Dal (JD)				5</p>
<p> Bahujan Samaj Party (BSP)		  3</p>
<p> Communist Party of India (Marxist)     1</p>
<p> Panthers' Party				1</p>
<p> Awami League				   1</p>
<p> Congress (Tiwari)			    1</p>
<p> Independents				   1</p>
<p>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -</p>
<p> Total seats declared:		     81</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>NOTE: Counting in the remaining six districts, where voting took place on Monday, will start on Thursday.</p>
</text>
